BaseVault_setEmergencyReceiver
├── when the caller does not have the CONFIG_OPERATOR_ROLE
│   └── it should revert
└── when the caller has the CONFIG_OPERATOR_ROLE
    ├── when the emergency receiver is the zero address
    │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
    └── when the emergency receiver is not the zero address
        └── it should set the emergency receiver and emit EmergencyReceiverSet
